Z||000000||Raydar||08-05-2000||04:01 PM||||This is from the Fiero Onelist. Thought it might be of use...<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>Subject: Re: (Fiero) Exhaust Manifold Stud/Bolts - NLA!!<P>Joe and all, here is an alternate. GM #21006951 Saturn intake manifold<BR>stud, and GM #11502609 flange nut.<P>Sold also by Au-ve-co Products by #18514 and 11644 respectively.<P>We are using the studs on all forward manifolds, as they are much<BR>stronger the the original bolts.<P>Just use 2 nuts where the manifold heat shields attach.<P>Ed Parks    (The Fiero Factory)<BR>8710B Hwy 53, Toney, Ala 35773<BR>Shop # 256-420-5391    Hm # 256-882-1568 <A HREF="http://www.welcome.to/thefierofactory" TARGET=_blank>http://www.welcome.to/thefierofactory</A> <BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR> <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (ISO big V-6)<P>"Some mornings, it just isn't worth<BR>chewing through the restraints."||||reg||3
